# Movement speed, the client side of server src-patch 0018 (server/README.md "Movement speed"): a player's step is rounded up to 10 ms (not the 50 ms beat) and a diagonal step of a player takes 7/5 of a straight one (stock 3x); monsters and NPCs step diagonally in a straight step's time, as the server moves them. The walk offset now moves over the whole step (a diagonal no longer runs a straight step's time and then stands). The path finders cost a diagonal 1.4 (stock 3), so clicked walks take diagonals.
